[[Category:Creatures]]

'''Stalagoomba''' is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]].<br>

==How to Acquire==

Found very rarely in [[Caves]].

Can very rarely spawn when picking a [[Stalagoom]].

==Notes==

*It's quite obvious they are a reference to a Goomba, an enemy from the Super Mario game series which looks like a mushroom.
*Credo quests (Miner, Cave Hermit(?)) may target Stalagoomba but seem to want you to catch or see a wild one, so they may not be valuable to stash for that purpose.

